  "goodToKnow": "Die Spaltung is a split or division: die Spaltung der Gesellschaft (a much-debated topic), die Spaltung einer Partei. In physics, die Kernspaltung is nuclear fission, discovered in Berlin in 1938 by Otto Hahn and Fritz Strassmann, and explained by Lise Meitner. The verb spalten means to split: Holz spalten, die Gemüter spalten (to divide opinion). Die Spalte is a crack or a column."
